To convert an altar to your god, sacrifice at it. It will say fomething about
a conflict between the temple's god and yours, and then the altar will either
convert to your god or stay the same. If it stays the same, keep trying.
Note: don't do this in a temple since the temple priest/ess doesn't
appreciate having the altar changed.
