>wand (only 2 charges <ugh>) and wish for it. What is the advantage of having
>it blessed?
You can find them like anything else, but it depends on luck. Having it blessed
makes it lighter, I think. By the way, when you get a wand of wishing, the
first thing you wish for is a blessed scroll of charging if you haven't ID'd 
charging scrolls yet,or a blessed magic marker if you have. You then use all the
charges in the WoW and recharge it. When the WoW runs out the 2nd time, 
continually zapping it will wrest one final wish from it. In your above case,
you would have gotten 6 wishes altogether, 1 for the MM or SoC, and 5 for
whatever you need. I always wish for a bag of holding if I haven't found one
yet.
